{
  "meta": {
    "site": "https://github.com/zengfr/n8n-workflow-all-templates",
    "tokenfree": "https://tokenyep.com/",
    "name": "Audit Shopify product images with ShotEdit, Gemini, Google Sheets, and Slack",
    "wechat": "youandme10086",
    "id": 18915,
    "update_time": "2026-09-27"
  },
  "name": "Audit Shopify product images with ShotEdit, Gemini and Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "5b0a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1100,
        -1260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 960,
        "height": 920,
        "content": "# Audit Shopify product images with ShotEdit, Gemini and Google Sheets\n\nPhone-shot product photos are often HEIC, 4000px wide, or several megabytes each. Mobile shoppers pay for that in load time. This workflow checks every product image on a schedule and turns the problems into a task list.\n\n## How it works\n\n1. A weekly schedule starts the run. **Set audit parameters** holds every value you need to change.\n2. Products come from Shopify and each image array is split into one row per image.\n3. Every image URL goes to the [ShotEdit Image Info API](https://shotedit.net/api-docs), a free endpoint that reads only the first 128KB and returns format, dimensions and a concrete recommendation.\n4. Images that come back clean are filtered out.\n5. Gemini turns the technical result into one instruction plus a priority.\n6. Findings go to Google Sheets and a one-line summary to Slack.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Connect Shopify, Google Sheets, Slack and Gemini credentials. The ShotEdit API needs no key.\n2. Open **Set audit parameters** and fill in your spreadsheet ID and Slack channel.\n3. Create a sheet with an `image_url` column so rows update in place.\n4. Run it once manually, then let the schedule take over.\n\n## Customization\n\nThe audit step only needs an image URL, so a column of URLs works as well as the Shopify catalogue."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Collect",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -80,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1040,
        "height": 460,
        "content": "## Collect product images\n\nThe schedule starts the run and each product's image array becomes one row per image."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Inspect",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1000,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "content": "## Inspect and filter\n\nOnly the first 128KB of each image is read. Images that are already fine stop here."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Explain",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1560,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 380,
        "height": 700,
        "content": "## Explain the fix\n\nGemini turns the technical finding into one instruction plus a priority."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1980,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1060,
        "height": 460,
        "content": "## Log and notify\n\nRows are matched on image_url, so a re-run updates the existing row instead of adding one."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0b0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Run the audit every Monday",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0b0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Set audit parameters",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "p1",
              "name": "sheet_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
            },
            {
              "id": "p2",
              "name": "sheet_name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Image audit"
            },
            {
              "id": "p3",
              "name": "slack_channel",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "#store-ops"
            },
            {
              "id": "p4",
              "name": "product_limit",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 50
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0b0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Get products from Shopify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.shopify",
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "limit": "={{ $('Set audit parameters').first().json.product_limit }}",
        "options": {},
        "resource": "product",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": false,
        "authentication": "accessToken"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0b0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Split product images into rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "include": "selectedOtherFields",
        "options": {},
        "fieldToSplitOut": "images",
        "fieldsToInclude": "title"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0b0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Inspect image with ShotEdit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "position": [
        1040,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://shotedit.net/api/v1/image-info",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "url",
              "value": "={{ $json.src }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0b0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Keep images that need work",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "position": [
        1280,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "exists",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.recommendation?.action }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.recommendation?.action }}",
              "rightValue": "ok"
            }
          ]
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0b0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Write a fix note with Gemini",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "position": [
        1600,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are helping an e-commerce team fix product images.\n\nProduct: {{ $('Split product images into rows').item.json.title }}\nImage URL: {{ $('Split product images into rows').item.json.src }}\nFormat: {{ $json.image.format }}\nDimensions: {{ $json.image.width }}x{{ $json.image.height }}\nFile size in bytes: {{ $json.source.bytes }}\nSuggested action: {{ $json.recommendation.action }}\nReason: {{ $json.recommendation.reason }}\n\nWrite one sentence telling a non-technical colleague what to do with this image, then a priority of high, medium or low on a new line starting with \"Priority: \". High means it hurts mobile shoppers today. Do not repeat the numbers above.",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.7
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0b0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Gemini model for fix notes",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "position": [
        1600,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "modelName": "models/gemini-2.5-flash"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0b0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Build the sheet row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        2020,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "r1",
              "name": "image_url",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Split product images into rows').item.json.src }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "r2",
              "name": "product",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Split product images into rows').item.json.title }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "r3",
              "name": "format",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Inspect image with ShotEdit').item.json.image.format }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "r4",
              "name": "width",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $('Inspect image with ShotEdit').item.json.image.width }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "r5",
              "name": "height",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $('Inspect image with ShotEdit').item.json.image.height }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "r6",
              "name": "kilobytes",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ Math.round(($('Inspect image with ShotEdit').item.json.source.bytes || 0) / 1024) }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "r7",
              "name": "action",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Inspect image with ShotEdit').item.json.recommendation.action }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "r8",
              "name": "fix_note",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.text }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "r9",
              "name": "fix_with",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Inspect image with ShotEdit').item.json.recommendation.tool_url }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0b0000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a",
      "name": "Log findings to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        2260,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": {},
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "matchingColumns": [
            "image_url"
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Set audit parameters').first().json.sheet_name }}"
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Set audit parameters').first().json.sheet_id }}"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.7
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0b0000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b",
      "name": "Collect the run summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "position": [
        2500,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "aggregate": "aggregateAllItemData"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b0b0000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c",
      "name": "Post the summary to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "position": [
        2740,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Image audit finished: {{ $json.data.length }} product images need attention. Details are in the audit sheet.",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Set audit parameters').first().json.slack_channel }}"
        },
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.5
    }
  ],
